{"version":1,"content":"<p>在工信部第413批新車申報目錄中，全新國產寶馬3系長軸距版現身。<strong>新車為第八代3系的國產加長版本，內部代號G58，共申報325L和330L兩個型號，預計2027年內投放市場。</strong>第八代3系燃油版（代號G50）已於2026年9月30日全球首發，純電i3同步亮相，本次申報為國產長軸版落地。全新3系全面擁抱Neue Klasse新世代設計語言，前臉經歷了數十年來最大幅度的變動。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584978.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.144158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_hash":"dbbf44ddbdfda3d7383934d6e5a26b04b1051b667e359bd4106342f5b342470e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}